From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jason920612 <jasonya2206@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 09:09:20 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Share single-value section data; sparse block storage and
 light (-Dquire.compressSections=sparse)

Containers holding the same single value share one immutable Data. Block
section storage and idle light nibbles can be held in a random-access
two-level sparse encoding; writes inflate, a background encoder
re-encodes cold sections and the main thread installs a result only if
the storage is unchanged. Light is frozen by tasks holding the light
write radius.

