+    // Quire start - frozen light: idle initialised nibbles are held in a sparse encoding (a fraction of 2 KiB).
+    // Invariant: frozen != null => not dirty, state INIT/HIDDEN, storageVisible == storageUpdating == null.
+    // Freezing is an updating operation (it must run where the light engine cannot run concurrently for this
